  "title": { "zh": "对齐表", "en": "Alignment table" },
  "short": { "zh": "让表格替你连线", "en": "Let the table draw the lines" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "字一多，连线就很难试全了。我们把它交给一张新的表：<part-ref to=\"align\"></part-ref>。一个词写在上面，一个词写在左边。",
        "en": "With more letters, it gets hard to try every way of drawing the lines. So we hand it to a new kind of table: the <part-ref to=\"align\"></part-ref>. One word goes along the top, the other down the left."
