    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "还是只看最后一步。盯住问号这一格对应的<b>两个最后的字</b>：左边词的第「行」个字，和上面词的第「列」个字。它们只有两种情况：<b>相同</b>，或者<b>不同</b>。",
        "en": "Once again, look only at the last step. Focus on the <b>two last letters</b> for the cell with the question mark: letter number “row” of the left word, and letter number “column” of the top word. There are only two cases: they are <b>the same</b>, or they are <b>different</b>."
      },
