    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "两种情况各想一想：<b>相同</b>时，这两个字能不能连成一根线？连上以后，剩下的字对应表里的哪一格？<b>不同</b>时，这两个字里至少有一个连不上线，把它丢掉，又对应哪一格？答案都藏在问号旁边已经算好的三格里。",
        "en": "Think through each case. When they are <b>the same</b>, can those two letters be linked by a line? Once they are, which cell of the table matches the letters that remain? When they are <b>different</b>, at least one of the two can’t get a line; drop it, and which cell matches then? The answers are all in the three cells next to the question mark, which are already computed."
      },
