    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "机器人在对齐表上一格一格地走，视野里看得见它左上、上面、左边的格子（标着 = 的格子，这一行和这一列的字相同）。「本格信息」里的「两字相同」告诉你，红框这一行和这一列的字是不是一样。想清楚两种情况各该读哪一格，再拼电路板。",
        "en": "The robot walks the alignment table cell by cell, and its view shows the cells up-left, up and left of it (a cell marked = is one where the row’s letter and the column’s letter match). In the This cell panel, “letters match” tells you whether the red frame’s row letter and column letter are the same. Work out which cell each case should read, then build the board."
      }
    }
  ],
  "mission": {
    "goal": {
      "zh": "拼出对齐表的电路，算出两个词最长的公共子序列有几个字（两个词里按顺序都出现的一串字）。",
      "en": "Build the alignment table’s circuit and work out the length of the longest common subsequence of two words (letters that appear in order in both)."
    },
    "how": {
      "zh": "前两个测试，就是你在<level-ref to=\"link\"></level-ref>里亲手连过的两道题。通过后，看看表格里藏着的连线。",
      "en": "The first two tests are the two puzzles you solved by hand in <level-ref to=\"link\"></level-ref>. Once you pass, look at the lines hidden in the table."
    }
  },
  "robot": "ranger",
  "unlock": "align",
  "trace": "lcs",
  "after": "lcs",
  "boardOpt": { "minScale": 0.66, "maxScale": 1.2 },
  "hints": [
    {
      "zh": "两个字相同时，这两个字可以连成一根线。连上以后剩下的字，对应问号的哪个邻居？只在相同时走这条路：用放行闸，条件接「两字相同」。",
      "en": "When the letters match, those two can be linked by a line. Once they are, which neighbour of the question mark matches the letters that remain? Take that way only when they match: use a Pass gate with “letters match” as its condition."
    },
    {
      "zh": "两个字不同时，至少有一个连不上：要么丢掉这一行的字（看上面），要么丢掉这一列的字（看左边）。",
      "en": "When the letters differ, at least one of them gets no line: either drop this row’s letter (look up) or drop this column’s letter (look left)."
    },
    {
      "zh": "要连得最多：把上面、左边和放行闸都接进「取较大」汇合器。",
      "en": "To get the most lines: wire up, left and the Pass gate all into a “max” Merger."
    }
  ],
  "world": "align",
  "facts": ["same"],
  "tests": [
    { "top": "CABD", "left": "ABCD" },
    { "top": "ABCBDAB", "left": "BDCABA" },
    { "top": "GATTACA", "left": "CATTAG" }
  ],
  "expected": [3, 4, 4],
  "solution": [
    "k = const[value=1]()",
    "a = add(view.ul, k)",
    "g = pass(facts.same, a)",
    "m = mmax(view.up, view.left, g)",
    "cell <- m"
  ],
  "border0": true,
  "debrief": {
    "title": { "zh": "表格替你连好了线", "en": "The table drew the lines for you" },
    "body": [
      {
        "zh": "在对齐表里，<b>每走一次对角线，就是连了一根线</b>。只有字相同才能走对角线，而路线总是从左上走向右下，所以线永远不会交叉。",
        "en": "In an alignment table, <b>every diagonal step is one line drawn</b>. You can only step diagonally where the letters match, and the path always runs from the top left to the bottom right, so the lines never cross."
      },
      {
        "zh": "7 个字对 6 个字，亲手试要试很久，表格只填了 56 个格子。两段一万个字母的 DNA，也只要填一亿个格子，电脑一眨眼就能算完。",
        "en": "7 letters against 6 would take ages to try by hand; the table filled in just 56 cells. Two stretches of DNA ten thousand letters long need only a hundred million cells, which a computer fills in the blink of an eye."
      }
    ],
    "note": {
      "zh": "对齐表：字相同，左上 + 1；不同，取上面和左边中较大的。",
      "en": "Alignment table: if the letters match, up-left + 1; if not, the larger of up and left."
    }
  }
}
